# /fast under a process override of the model: the save's report -- a layer
# above the profile still decides a fresh session's model -- is the line
# above `* fast: on`, as fx persists before it announces
# (`applyFastMode`, `session_commands.zig:781-797`).
models models.json
seed fast-seed-opus.json
env FX_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-5 XFX_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-5
wait 2.5
snap start
type /fast
key Enter
wait 1
snap fast-on
home fast-on
type /fast
key Enter
wait 1
snap fast-off
home end
